{'symbol': 'BDX', 'date': '2019-10-28 19:30:00', 'title': 'BECTON DICKINSON SAYS WILL VOLUNTARILY SUSPEND STERILIZATION OPERATIONS AT ITS COVINGTON FACILITY FROM OCT. 30 TO NOV.6', 'text': "BECTON DICKINSON - ON OCTOBER 28, 2019, BD ENTERED INTO AN AGREEMENT WITH EPD, THAT RESOLVED LITIGATION.BECTON DICKINSON - UNDER TERMS OF SETTLEMENT, BD WILL VOLUNTARILY SUSPEND STERILIZATION OPERATIONS AT ITS COVINGTON FACILITY FROM OCT. 30 TO NOV.6.BECTON DICKINSON - BASED ON TERMS OF SETTLEMENT & BD'S BUSINESS CONTINUITY EFFORTS, BD DOES NOT EXPECT A MATERIAL IMPACT TO ITS RESULTS OF OPERATIONS.BECTON DICKINSON - WHEN BD RESUMES STERILIZATION OPERATIONS AT COVINGTON FACILITY ON NOVEMBER 7, 2019, BD WILL OPERATE FACILITY AT A REDUCED CAPACITY.BD - WHEN CO RESUMES STERILIZATION OPERATIONS AT COVINGTON FACILITY, WILL IMPLEMENT OPERATIONAL MODIFICATIONS TO FURTHER REDUCE ETHYLENE OXIDE EMISSIONS.BECTON DICKINSON - ALSO AGREED NOT TO EXPAND OPERATIONS AT ITS MADISON, GEORGIA FACILITY.BECTON DICKINSON - AGREED TO CONTINUE IMPLEMENTING ADDITIONAL EMISSION CONTROLS AT ITS COVINGTON AND MADISON FACILITIES."}{'symbol': 'BDX', 'date': '2019-10-27 22:30:00', 'title': 'BECTON, DICKINSON AND COMPANY PRESENTS AT EVERCORE ISI 2ND ANNUAL HEALTHCONX CONFERENCE, DEC-04-2019 11:45 AM', 'text': 'BECTON, DICKINSON AND COMPANY PRESENTS AT EVERCORE ISI 2ND ANNUAL HEALTHCONX CONFERENCE, DEC-04-2019 11:45 AM. VENUE: FOUR SEASONS HOTEL BOSTON, BOSTON, MASSACHUSETTS, UNITED STATES.'}